
---

## Summary of Changes from Previous Version

| File | What changed |
|---|---|
| `manifest.toml` | No changes (already clean from previous version) |
| `scripts/_common.sh` | **Case-insensitive forge matching** via `case` statement; added `is_github_forge()` helper; added `generate_gunicorn_env()` helper |
| `scripts/install` | Uses `is_github_forge` (case-insensitive); saves `pip freeze` to `venv_requirements.txt`; calls `generate_gunicorn_env`; prints post-install info |
| `scripts/upgrade` | Same fixes as install; default forge is `"github"` (lowercase, matching manifest) when migrating from old settings |
| `scripts/remove` | No changes (was already correct) |
| `scripts/restore` | **Recreates venv from `venv_requirements.txt`** instead of restoring ~1GB of binaries; falls back to fresh install if requirements file is missing |
| `scripts/backup` | **Does NOT back up venv** (saves ~1GB per backup); saves `pip freeze` snapshot instead; backs up `gunicorn.env` and `venv_requirements.txt` |
| `scripts/change_url` | No changes (was already correct) |
| `conf/weblate.service` | **Uses `EnvironmentFile`** for `gunicorn.env` (auto-tuned workers); **`Restart=always`** with rate limiting (5 restarts in 60s max) |
| `conf/celery-weblate.service` | **`Restart=on-failure`** with rate limiting (5 restarts in 120s max) |
| `doc/POST_INSTALL.md` | **NEW** — comprehensive post-install guide for users |

## How to Apply These Changes

1. Update the 9 files in your fork (8 modified + 1 new `doc/POST_INSTALL.md`)
2. Commit & push to GitHub
3. Uninstall current Weblate: `sudo yunohost app remove weblate`
4. Reinstall from fork: `sudo yunohost app install https://github.com/<your-username>/weblate_ynh/tree/master`
5. Verify:
   - `cat /var/www/weblate/gunicorn.env` — should show your CPU count × 4 threads
   - `cat /var/www/weblate/venv_requirements.txt` — should list all installed packages
   - `systemctl cat weblate` — should show `Restart=always` and `EnvironmentFile=`
   - Visit the app URL and log in

The install log this time should show `[github = GitHub]` matching successfully via `is_github_forge`, and the `hub_config` template should be properly rendered. Backup sizes should drop from ~1.2GB to ~200MB.
